flowchart TD
  flags[Command-line flags]
  env[Environment and key files]
  providers[Provider registry]
  gguf[Local GGUF model]
  runner[LLM runner]
  cloud[Cloud endpoints]
  air[Air-gapped guard]
  bind[GUI bind address]

  flags -->|names a model| runner
  env -->|supplies API keys| providers
  providers -->|cloud descriptor| runner
  gguf -->|path from flags| runner
  runner -->|cloud calls| cloud
  air -->|blocks before the network| runner
  air -->|deletes keys| env
  flags -->|host flag| bind
  air -->|refuses non-loopback| bind

%% tip: Air-gapped guard :: Two layers: keys scrubbed at startup, every cloud call site guarded.
